; An assignment sees the postings of its own account written above it in the
; same entry, and not the ones below; two assignments in one entry are read
; in turn, and an elided posting takes what they leave.

2024-01-01 Opening
    Assets:Checking    = $10
    Assets:Savings     = $20
    Equity:Opening

2024-01-02 Above
    Assets:Checking    $3
    Assets:Checking    = $15
    Income:Salary

2024-01-03 Below
    Assets:Checking    = $20
    Assets:Checking    $3
    Income:Salary
